<title>USA: Fort Howard names Riordan as CEO.</title>
<headline>Fort Howard names Riordan as CEO.</headline>
<dateline>GREEN BAY, Wis. 1996-09-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>Fort Howard Corp said Wednesday its board had named Michael Riordan, currently president and chief operating officer, as president and chief executive officer, effective October 1.</p>
<p>He will succeed Donald DeMeuse, chairman and chief executive officer since 1992.</p>
<p>DeMeuse will retire as chairman on March 1, 1997, after 30 years at the company, it added.</p>
<p>Riordan, 46, became president and a member of the board in March 1992. He joined the company in 1987.</p>
<p>-- Chicago Newsdesk 312-408-8787</p>
</text>
